{"id":"d8fd59fd127843f3","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-symmetry.md","title":"Symmetry Using Canonical Shortest Descriptions","display":"thm-symmetry — Symmetry Using Canonical Shortest Descriptions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-symmetry","aliases":["43-thm-symmetry"],"display":"thm-symmetry — Symmetry Using Canonical Shortest Descriptions","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-condkolm]]","[[43-df-shortest-description]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 6.10.2 and Corollary 6.10.3","source_printed_pages":"107–108","source_pdf_pages":"127–128","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-symmetry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-symmetry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-symmetry — Symmetry Using Canonical Shortest Descriptions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d74032e32e804fb\" href=\"?note=1d74032e32e804fb\" title=\"43-df-condkolm\">43-df-condkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6f3e60136c4c0887\" href=\"?note=6f3e60136c4c0887\" title=\"43-df-shortest-description\">43-df-shortest-description</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 6.10.2 and Corollary 6.10.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"107–108"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"127–128"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。 条件复杂度采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1d74032e32e804fb\" href=\"?note=1d74032e32e804fb\" title=\"43-df-condkolm\">43-df-condkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^*,\\tau^*\">\\(\\sigma^*,\\tau^*\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6f3e60136c4c0887\" href=\"?note=6f3e60136c4c0887\" title=\"43-df-shortest-description\">43-df-shortest-description</a> 的规范最短描述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\left|K(\\sigma,\\tau)-K(\\sigma)-K(\\tau\\mid\\sigma^*)\\right|\\le c\\land\\left|K(\\sigma,\\tau)-K(\\tau)-K(\\sigma\\mid\\tau^*)\\right|\\le c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\left|K(\\sigma,\\tau)-K(\\sigma)-K(\\tau\\mid\\sigma^*)\\right|\\le c\\land\\left|K(\\sigma,\\tau)-K(\\tau)-K(\\sigma\\mid\\tau^*)\\right|\\le c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>替换原来没有绑定的最短描述星号。由最短程序可恢复输出及程序长度；由输出和其复杂度可搜索规范首次最短程序，故这两种辅助信息相互有效转换。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.10.2 and Corollary 6.10.3；印刷页 107–108，PDF 页 127–128。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condkolm","status":"resolved","id":"1d74032e32e804fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-shortest-description","status":"resolved","id":"6f3e60136c4c0887","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-shortest-description]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。 $\\sigma^*,\\tau^*$ 是 [[43-df-shortest-description]] 的规范最短描述。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。 $\\sigma^*,\\tau^*$ 是 [[43-df-shortest-description]] 的规范最短描述。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condkolm","status":"resolved","id":"1d74032e32e804fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。 $\\sigma^*,\\tau^*$ 是 [[43-df-shortest-description]] 的规范最短描述。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-shortest-description","status":"resolved","id":"6f3e60136c4c0887","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 条件复杂度采用 [[43-df-condkolm]] 的 $K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$。 $\\sigma^*,\\tau^*$ 是 [[43-df-shortest-description]] 的规范最短描述。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma^*,\\tau^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\left|K(\\sigma,\\tau)-K(\\sigma)-K(\\tau\\mid\\sigma^*)\\right|\\le c\\land\\left|K(\\sigma,\\tau)-K(\\tau)-K(\\sigma\\mid\\tau^*)\\right|\\le c\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-symmetry]] — Symmetry Using Canonical Shortest Descriptions"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848","1d74032e32e804fb","6f3e60136c4c0887","e039afac1517f3d7"]}